  "name": "Mpox with a rodent reservoir and residual smallpox vaccination immunity",
  "description": "Mpox (monkeypox), rodent reservoir → humans.\nTwo usable regimes from one structure: (a) the classical African setting — spillover-driven, R0h < 1, outbreaks that fade without the reservoir term; (b) a 2022-style outbreak — set beta_rh = 0, raise beta_hh above threshold, and read S as\nParameter values: 0 of 15 checked against the source; the rest are recalled or illustrative.",
